OL,3,GNEWSADeaf couple's unsafe home rebuilt
OL,4,Aon DIY SOS
OL,5,
OL,6,FA profoundly deaf couple, whose home
OL,7,Fwas left unsafe by unfinished building
OL,8,Fwork, will see it being transformed by
OL,9,Fhundreds of volunteers when the latest
OL,10,Fepisode of DIY SOS is broadcast.
OL,12,FAhmed and Rifat Ali, from Bitterne in
OL,13,FSouthampton, lost #72,000 on a ground
OL,14,Ffloor extension which was halted and
OL,15,Flater condemned.
OL,17,FThe couple and their three children
OL,18,Fwere left living upstairs, unable to
OL,19,Fuse their kitchen or garden, until the
OL,20,Fhit BBC show's team rebuilt the house
OL,21,Flast October.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
